  "instance_name": "misogynous_stereotype_objectification",
  "label": "Misogynous Stereotype: Objectification",
  "description": "The meme uses the phrase 'hold my hookah pipe!' to imply that the Black woman is being 'held' or controlled by a male perspective, which is a form of objectification. This stereotype reduces her to an object of male desire or control, rather than recognizing her as a person with agency and autonomy. This is a form of misogynous objectification that reinforces the idea that Black women are only valuable if they are controlled or dominated by men.",
